data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"lookupStatus\": \"found\",\n    \"group\": {\n      \"platform\": \"facebook\",\n      \"id\": \"1688114615260114\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1688114615260114\",\n      \"name\": \"Parents of Class of 2026-Parenting Beyond The Nest\",\n      \"description\": \"Welcome to Parents of Class of 2026 – PARENTING BEYOND THE NEST, a community for parents whose students have graduated and are beginning their next chapter. Whether that journey includes college, the military, trade school, a gap year, or entering the workforce, this is a place to navigate it together.\\n\\nGraduation may mark the end of high school, but it isn't the end of parenting. Whether you're adjusting to an empty nest, helping your student settle into college, or still juggling younger children at home, this community is here to support you through this new season of life.\\n\\nThis group is a place to:\\n🔴 Share encouragement as we adjust to our evolving roles as parents\\n🟡 Exchange advice, experiences, and lessons learned along the way\\n🟢 Find support and community with parents navigating the same transition\\n\\nOur students may be launching into adulthood, but here we focus on what it means to continue PARENTING BEYOND THE NEST. We're so glad you're here.\\n\\nWe have a great group of experts and seasoned parents who are here to answer questions, offer support, and share valuable insights every step of the way.\\n\\nNote: This group is part of the Ready Set College network of parent communities, including Parents of the Classes of 2025,2026, 2027, 2028, 2029, 2030, 2031, 2032, and beyond.\\n\\nDisclaimer: Some posts shared by admin may contain affiliate links. I may earn a small commission at zero cost to members. Your support helps cover the time and expense of providing free resources, content, and support for this community. We appreciate your support!\\n\\nAbout Ready Set College\\nHi! I'm Tamara, founder of Ready Set College. I'm not a large company or corporation, just a mom of two who has experienced the college journey firsthand. One of my children has already graduated from college and grad school, and the other is currently in college, so I've experienced many of the same questions, challenges, and milestones you're facing now. My goal is to create a supportive community where parents can connect, learn, and help one another through every stage of the journey. If you're interested in partnering with our community, you can reach me at dormroomsandbeyond@gmail.com\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2024-04-26T15:41:24.000Z\",\n      \"historySummary\": \"Group created on April 26, 2024. Name last changed on August 19, 2026.\",\n      \"privacy\": {\n        \"label\": \"Public\",\n        \"description\": \"Anyone can see who's in the group and what they post.\"\n      },\n      \"visibility\": {\n        \"label\": \"Visible\",\n        \"description\": \"Anyone can find this group.\"\n      },\n      \"categories\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1282128838821054\",\n          \"name\": \"Education\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"354007908454271\",\n          \"name\": \"College & Adult Education\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"memberCount\": 223699,\n      \"administratorCount\": 4,\n      \"moderatorCount\": 10,\n      \"administrators\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"61570130213944\",\n          \"name\": \"Dorm Rooms Of Mississippi\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/dorm.rooms.of.mississippi\",\n          \"profilePictureUrl\": \"https://scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-1/732179035_122164639382671007_5508250522460523010_n.jpg?stp=cp0_dst-jpg_tt6&cstp=mx1254x1254&ctp=s32x32&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=111fe6&_nc_ohc=pXyP56S9qEEQ7kNvwF-w2VI&_nc_oc=Adq2-HPGLbkfi3XzP6CPGfX2oQ63d8FQkz4CeBbEthl4bMF6ANgPoosVkJAMBBJnYA0&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.xx&_nc_gid=RZ0m62h4dhnkRmBHLxh75g&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQR0EsVOcs_eZ