k7VZDDiqXjMXE&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.xx&_nc_gid=RZ0m62h4dhnkRmBHLxh75g&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQRTXUWgRJRXJrytYuKD2fB0NlZ8zyTvrdi6dfZoJlShYg&oe=6AF3D599"}],"activity":{"postsLastDay":15,"postsLastMonth":543,"newMembersText":"No new members in the last week"},"rules":[{"id":"1704256026979306","title":"No Self-Promotion, Spam, or External Websites:","description":"Self-promotion, solicitation, spam, or reshared content is not allowed in this group. Members may not post links—including those promoting businesses, services, products, other Facebook groups, or external websites. I may occasionally share affiliate links and earn a small commission at no extra cost to you; this helps support the group. To be considered as an approved partner or expert, email Dormroomsandbeyond@gmail.com with your info. – Tamara"},{"id":"1704256113645964","title":"Respect Each Other & the Group","description":"Treat all members with respect—healthy debate is fine, but kindness is required. This is a supportive space for parents to share experiences and offer constructive advice. Posts or comments that are rude, offensive, or inappropriate will be removed. This group also relies on mutual trust: what’s shared here should stay here, as discussions may be sensitive or personal."},{"id":"1704256180312624","title":"Limit DuplicateQuestions","description":"We often get the same questions (like FAFSA, Common App, and other common subjects) multiple times a day. To keep the group easy to follow, please use the search bar or check recent posts before posting. If you don’t find what you need, you’re welcome to ask again another day."},{"id":"2030033517734887","title":"Topic-Specific Posts & Days","description":"To keep the group organized and easy to navigate, we’ve created dedicated posts and themed days for popular topics such as Senior Sundays, school-specific admission threads, homecoming, and prom. If your post fits one of these categories, it may be declined and you’ll be directed to the appropriate thread. This helps reduce repetition and ensures everyone can quickly find what they’re looking for"},{"id":"1876900956381478","title":"This is a Nationwide Group","description":"This is a nationwide group. Please refrain from asking questions specific to a particular high school. If you have questions that pertain to your specific high school, we recommend finding and joining your school's dedicated Facebook group"},{"id":"1715036555901253","title":"Stay On Topic:","description":"Please keep posts and comments relevant to the interests and concerns of parents of the Class of 2026. Off-topic posts may be removed.  No Political or Religious Discussions: To maintain a neutral and supportive environment, discussions involving politics or religion are not permitted."},{"id":"1715036562567919","title":"Report Issues to Admins:","description":"If you see something that violates these rules or seems inappropriate, please report it to the admins. Do not engage in public arguments or confrontations."}]}},"meta":{"requestId":"req_30411147-3f75-44f3-b44e-2db1f4238116","creditsCharged":1,"version":"v1"},"card":{"kind":"profile","title":"Parents of Class of 2026-Parenting Beyond The Nest","subtitle":"Public · Education, College & Adult Education","platform":"Facebook","headline":"Welcome to Parents of Class of 2026 – PARENTING BEYOND THE NEST, a community for parents whose students have graduated and are beginning their next chapter. Whether that journey includes college, the military, trade scho","verified":false,"metrics":[{"label":"Members","value":"224k"},{"label":"Posts / day","value":"15"},{"label":"Posts / month","value":"543"}],"details":["Created 26 Apr 2024","No new members in the last week"],"href":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1688114615260114","sourceLabel":"Open group","avatar":{"kind":"fallback","initial":"P"},"sections":[{"title":"Admins","rows":[{"title":"Dorm Rooms Of Mississippi","href":"https://www.facebook.com/dorm.rooms.of.mississippi"},{"tit